<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 5.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 5.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the</p>
<p>following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for</p>
<p>Monday, May 5:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,495.90 (1,492.90)	CHF  1,017.80 (1,017.00)</p>
<p>    DEM    865.68 (866.15)	  GBP  2,427.10 (2,406.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    123.01 (123.09)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Saturday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $11.88 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$12.16 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $24.04 million ($22.97 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
